  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996 in Varginha, a town in Brazil, people say a strange creature was caught, and a police officer named Marco Chereze, said to have helped catch it, later fell ill and died. A podcast host, Jesse Michels, says that Cesario, a doctor who treated Chereze, recalls Chereze telling him again and again that his illness might come from the ET, short for extraterrestrial, that he had caught. If true, it would tie the officer's death directly to contact with a being not from Earth."
}
